  "term": "user-friendly",
  "definition": "User-friendly describes a tool or system that is easy for people to use, with features that make tasks understandable and manageable without requiring technical expertise such as coding. In this context, it also implies a clear, accessible workflow that helps users complete a process from start to finish.",
